{"4853840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Leaving school story", "steam_appid": 4853840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I just wanted to go home. That's all it was...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist encounters strange events on the way home from school. Will he be able to make it home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Explore the Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rule of the game is simple: just go home. But along the way, there are people you can talk to and objects you can examine, and by finding them you can experience mysterious stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From slightly horror-tinged tales to stories that feel oddly familiar, enjoy the various stories you get swept up in on your way home from school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD<br>Camera: Mouse<br>Interact: E<br>Pause/Settings Menu: Esc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※ Regarding the Use of Generative AI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses generative AI for the textures and images of some objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※ Regarding Streaming Permissions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video uploads and live streaming of this game are permitted without contacting the developer. Monetization on video platforms is also allowed. However, commercial or for-profit use of the content itself is not permitted.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I just wanted to go home. That's all it was...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist encounters strange events on the way home from school. Will he be able to make it home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Explore the Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rule of the game is simple: just go home. But along the way, there are peopl